00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:22,250
Problem 3:

4
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:36,820
A car travels distance 170 km with speed 42.5 km/hour.

5
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:46,970
Calculate time car takes to travel that distance?

6
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:59,800
To calculate travel time of car, we take distance traveled divided by car speed.

7
00:01:01,250 --> 00:01:05,970
How to write solution?

8
00:01:10,310 --> 00:01:14,480
Time car travels is:

9
00:01:15,510 --> 00:01:27,080
170 : 42.5 = 4 (hours)

10
00:01:28,910 --> 00:01:33,880
Answer: 4 hours.

11
00:01:36,450 --> 00:01:50,940
Rule: To calculate time we take distance divided by speed.

12
00:01:53,050 --> 00:02:19,340
If we call s distance, v speed, t time, then we have formula:

13
00:02:19,970 --> 00:02:26,370
t = s : v

